# Who reviews changes to this repo.
#
# Every file, so that every pull request goes past a second pair of eyes before
# it reaches the live site.
#
# The repo is public, so GitHub applies this file on the free plan and requests
# the review automatically. .github/workflows/request-review.yml asks too; it
# was the only thing that worked while the repo was private, and it has been
# seen working on real pull requests. Once a review request from this file has
# been seen on a teammate's PR, that workflow can be deleted. If you change the
# reviewer, change it in both places until then.
#
# A team handle would be better than one person once a web-dev team exists. A
# team only counts as an owner if it is visible and has write access to this
# repository, so check any change here with:
#
#   gh api repos/uwigem/wiki2026/codeowners/errors

